("Dry cleaning",49,"Waterless cleaning liquids with hand or machine agitation."),
("Dry vacuuming, air washing, solvent cleaning",50,"How newer, lightly or moderately sooted upholstery can be cleaned without browning, bleeding or shrinking."),
