("Protected surface or ultrasonic",53,"Where blinds are wet cleaned and deodorized."),
("Colored, decorative trim",53,"Causes problems when wet cleaning fabric lampshades. Handle shades by the top of the metal frame only."),
("Inspected first, then cleaned",53,"Electronics: inspect, then clean and test by a qualified technician."),
("Inspected (toys)",54,"Toys: inspect, wet clean, rinse and sanitize."),
